== Notes ==

* Animal merchants under the influence of this spell will suffer a -20 penalty to their opposed [[appraise]] check (if they make one) when opening their store. This usually means that prices are adjusted 20% (of the item's value) in the PC's favor.
* This spell produces the same result (plus the merchant adjustment) as the [[animal empathy]] skill. The main differences lie in range (medium vs. touch), duration (rounds vs. [[turn]]s), and the chance of success ([[saving throw]] vs. [[skill check]]). In addition, the skill can target a wider array of creatures (animals, beasts, and magical beasts), but has a chance of making the target hostile.
* Dominated creatures increase the [[party size penalty]] for [[experience point]]s.
*Due to a .2da bug, ''dominate animal'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of ''clarity''.

